cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "VICTUS"
message: "If you use VICTUS in research or a write-up, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Fahim Hussain"
    alias: FAHTHIZ
repository-code: "https://github.com/FAHTHIZ/VICTUS"
abstract: >-
  Independent, open-source C++20 game engine and editor for complete 2D and 3D games. VICTUS Studio
  builds whole games from no-code Behaviours, Luau scripts, visual graphs or C++, on an engine with
  physically based rendering over Vulkan, Metal, D3D12 and OpenGL ES, Jolt and Box2D physics,
  navigation and behaviour-tree AI, skeletal animation, spatial audio, server-authoritative
  multiplayer and one-command export.
keywords:
  - game-engine
  - game-editor
  - cpp20
  - 2d
  - 3d
  - pbr-rendering
  - luau
  - no-code
license: Apache-2.0
